{
  "title": "Ziyaarat-e-Aashoora Ghair Ma'roofah",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ رَسُوْلِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA RASOOLIL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O son of Allah’s Messenger.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ الْبَشِيْرِ النَّذِيْرِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNAL BASHEERIN NAZEERE \nPeace be upon you, O son of the bearer of glad tidings and the warner\nوَ ابْنَ سَيِّدِ الْوَصِيِّيْنَ \nWABNA SAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA \nand son of the chief of the Prophets’ successors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ فَاطِمَةَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATA \nPeace be upon you, O son of Fatemah\nسَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ \nSAYYEDATE NESAAA-IL A’ALAMEENA \nthe doyenne of the women of the worlds.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خِيَرَةَ اللهِ وَ ابْنَ خِيَرَتِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHEYARATAL LAAHE WABNA KHEYARATE \nPeace be upon you, O choicest of Allah and son of His choicest.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا ثَارَ اللهِ وَ ابْنَ ثَارِهٖ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAARAL LAAHE WABNA SAAREHI \nPeace be upon you, O vengeance of Allah and son of His vengeance.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْوِتْرُ الْمَوْتُوْرُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL WITRUL MAWTOORO \nPeace be upon you, O he who has not been avenged so far.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْاِمَامُ الْهَادِىُ الزَّكِىُّ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL EMAAMUL HAADEYUZ ZAKIYYO\nPeace be upon you, O guide and pure leader,\nوَ عَلٰى اَرْوَاحٍ حَلَّتْ بِفِنَآئِكَ \nWA A’LAA ARWAAHIN HALLAT BE-FENAAA-EKA \nand upon souls that gathered in your courtyard,\nوَ اَقَامَتْ فِىْ جِوَارِكَ \nWA AQAAMAT FEE JEWAAREKA \nresided in your vicinity,\nوَ وَفَدَتْ مَعَ زُوَّارِكَ \nWA WAFADAT MA-A’ ZUWWAREKA \nand came with your visitors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ مِنِّىْ مَا بَقِيْتُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA MINNEE MAA BAQEETO \nPeace be upon you from me as long as I am existent \nوَ بَقِىَ اللَّيْلُ وَ النَّهَارُ \nWA BAQEYAL LAYLO WAN NAHAARO \nand as long as there are day and night.\nفَلَقَدْ عَظُمَتْ بِكَ الرَّزِيَّةُ \nFA-LAQAD A’ZOMAT BEKAR RAZIYYATO \nSo indeed, the catastrophe because of you has become great,\nوَ جَلَّتْ فِى الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُسْلِمِيْنَ \nWA JALLAT FIL MOMENEENA WAL MUSLEMEENA \nand it has become enormous for the believers and the Muslims,\nوَ فِىْ اَهْلِ السَّمٰوَاتِ وَ اَهْلِ الْاَرَضِيْنَ اَجْمَعِيْنَ \nWA FEE AHLIS SAMAAWAATE WA AHLIL ARAZEENA AJMAE’ENA \nand upon all the inhabitants of the heavens and the earth.\nفَاِنَّ لِلّٰهِ وَ اِنَّ اِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُوْنَ \nFA INNAA LILLAAHE WA INNAA ELAYHE RAAJEO’ONA \nSo, we are Allah’s and to Him shall we return.\nصَلَوَاتُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ وَ تَحِيَّاتُهٗ عَلَيْكَ \nSALAWAATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU WA TAHIYYATOHU A’LAYKA \nAllah’s benedictions, blessings, and greetings\nيَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ الْحُسَيْنِ \nYAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHIL HUSAYNE \nbe upon you, O Abu Abdillah al-Husain,\nوَ عَلٰى اٰبَآئِكَ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ الْمُنْتَجَبِيْنَ \nWA A’LAA AABAAA-EKAT TAYYEBEENAL MUNTAJABEENA \nupon your fathers the immaculate and finely selected,\nوَ عَلٰى ذُرِّيَّاتِكُمُ الْهُدَاةِ الْمَهْدِيِّيْنَ \nWA A’LAA ZURRIYYAATEKOMUL HODAATIL MAHDIYYEENA \nand upon your offspring the guide and well-guided.\nلَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً خَذَلَتْكَ \nLA-A’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN KHAZALATKA \nMay Allah curse the people who disappointed you\nوَ تَرَكَتْ نُصْرَتَكَ وَ مَعُوْنَتَكَ \nWA TARAKAT NUSRATAKA WA MA-O’ONATAKA\nand abstained from supporting and aiding you.\nوَ لَعَنَ اللهُ اُمَّةً اَسَّسَتْ اَسَاسَ الظُّلْمِ لَكُمْ \nWA LA-A’NAL LAAHO UMMATAN ASSASAT ASAASAZ ZULME LAKUM\nMay Allah curse the people who laid the basis of persecution against you,\nوَ مَهَّدَتِ الْجَوْرَ عَلَيْكُمْ \nWA MAH-HADATIL JAWRA A’LAYKUM\npaved the way for transgression against you,\nوَ طَرَّقَتْ اِلٰى اَذِيَّتِكُمْ وَ تَحَيُّفِكُمْ \nWA TARRAQAT ELAA AZIYYATEKUM WA TAHAYYOFEKUM \nopened the way towards injuring and wronging you,\nوَ جَارَتْ ذٰلِكَ فِىْ دِيَارِكُمْ وَ اَشْيَاعِكُمْ \nWA JAARAT ZAALEKA FEE DEYAAREKUM WA ASH-YAA-E’KUM \nand spread so in your lands and against your adherents.\nبَرِئْتُ اِلَى اللهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ وَ اِلَيْكُمْ \nBA-REA-TO ELAL LAAHE A’ZZA WA JALLA WA ELAYKUM \nI declare my repudiation in the presence of Allah, Majestic and Mighty be He, and in the presence of you,\nيَا سَادَاتِىْ وَ مَوَالِىَّ وَ اَئِمَّتِىْ مِنْهُمْ \nYAA SAADAATEE WA MAWALIYYA WA A-IMMATEE MINHUM \nO my masters, chiefs, and leaders,\nوَ مِنْ اَشْيَاعِهِمْ وَ اَتْبَاعِهِمْ \nWA MIN ASHYAA-E’HIM WA AT-BAA-E’HIM \nfrom them, their adherents, and their followers.\nوَ اَسْئَلُ اللهَ الَّذِىْ اَكْرَمَ يَا مَوَالِىَّ مَقَامَكُمْ \nWA AS-ALUL LAAHAL LAZEE AKRAMA YAA MAWAALIYYA MAQAAMAKUM \nAnd I ask Allah, Who honored, O my Masters, your station, \nوَ شَرَّفَ مَنْزِلَتَكُمْ وَ شَاْنَكُمْ \nWA SHARRAFA MANZELATAKUM WA SHAANAKUM \nand elevated your rank and your status, \nاَنْ يُّكْرِمَنِىْ بِوِلاَيَتِكُمْ وَ مَحَبَّتِكُمْ \nANY YUKREMANEE BE-WELAAYATEKUM WA MAHABBATEKUM \nto honor me with your guardianship (allegiance) and your love, \nوَ الْاِيْتِمَامِ بِكُمْ وَ بِالْبَرَآئَةِ مِنْ اَعْدَآئِكُمْ \nWAL EETEMAAME BEKUM WA BIL-BARAA-ATE MIN AA’DAAA-EKUM \nand with taking you as my leaders, and with disassociation from your enemies.\nوَ اَسْئَلُ اللهَ الْبَرَّ الرَّحِيْمَ \nWA AS-ALUL LAAHAL BARRAR RAHEEMA \nAnd I beseech Allah, the Benign and Merciful, \nاَنْ يَّرْزُقَنِىْ مَوَدَّتَكُمْ وَ اَنْ يُّوَفِّقَنِىْ لِلطَّلَبِ بِثَارِكُمْ \nANY YARZOQANEE MAWADDATAKUM WA ANY YOWAFFEQANEE LITTALABE BE-SAAREKUM \nto grant me your affection, and to grant me success in seeking your vengeance (revenge) \nمَعَ الْاِمَامِ الْمُنْتَظَرِ الْهَادِىْ مِنْ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nMA-A’L EMAAMIL MUNTAZARIL HAADEE MIN AALE MOHAMMADIN \nwith the awaited, guided Imam from the Household of Muhammad, \nوَّ اَنْ يَّجْعَلَنِىْ مَعَكُمْ فِىْ الدُّنْيَا وَ الْاٰخِرَةِ \nWA ANY YAJ-A’LANEE MA-A’KUM FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE \nand to include me with you in this world and the Hereafter,\nوَ اَنْ يُّبَلِّغَنِىْ الْمَقَامَ الْمَحْمُوْدَ لَكُمْ عِنْدَ اللهِ \nWA ANY YOBALLEGHA-NIL MAQAAMAL MAHMOODA LAKUM I’NDAL LAAHE\nand to make me attain the Praiseworthy Position that you enjoy with Allah.\nوَ اَسْئَلُ اللهَ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ بِحَقِّكُمْ \nWA ASALUL LAAHA A’ZZA WA JALLA BE-HAQQEKUM\nAnd I beseech Allah, Mighty and Majestic be He, in the name of your right\nوَ بِالشَّاْنِ الَّذِىْ جَعَلَ اللهُ لَكُمْ \nWA BISH-SHAANIL LAZEE JA-A’LAL LAAHO LAKUM \nand in the name of the status that you enjoy with Him,\nاَنْ يُّعْطِيَنِىْ بِمُصَابِىْ بِكُمْ \nANY YO’TEYANEE BE-MOSAABEE BEKUM\nto grant me, on account of my commiseration for you,\nاَفْضَلَ مَا اَعْطٰى مُصَابًاۢ بِمُصِيْبَةٍ \nAFZALA MAA AA’TAA MOSAABAN BE-MOSEEBATIN \nthe most favorable of that which He has ever granted to any one afflicted with a misfortune.\nاِنَّا لِلّٰهِ وَ اِنَّا اِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُوْنَ \nINNAA LILLAAHE WA INNAA ELAYHE RAAJEO’ONA \nTo Allah do we belong and to Him shall we return.\nيَا لَهَا مِنْ مُّصِيْبَةٍ مَّا اَفْجَعَهَا وَ اَنْكَاهَا \nYAA LAHAA MIM MOSEEBATIN MAA AF-JA-A’HAA WA ANKAAHAA \nWhat a terrible misfortune it was;\nلِقُلُوْبِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُسْلِمِيْنَ \nLE-QOLOOBIL MOMENEENA WAL MUSLEMEENA \nhow a calamitous and painful misfortune it was for the hearts of the believers and Muslims.\nفَاِنَّا لِلّٰهِ وَ اِنَّا اِلَيْهِ رَاجِعُوْنَ \nFA-INNAA LILLAAHE WA INNAA ELAYHE RAAJEO’ONA \nSo, to Allah do we belong and to His shall we return.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nO Allah! Send blessings upon Muḥammad and the Household of Muḥammad, \nوَّ اجْعَلْنِىْ فِىْ مَقَامِىْ\nWAJ A’LNEE FEE MAQAAMEE \nand make me, in my present state, \nمِمَّنْ تَنَالُهٗ مِنْكَ صَلَوَاتٌ وَّ رَحْمَةٌ وَّ مَغْفِرَةٌ \nMIMMAN TANAALOHU MINKA SALAWAATUN WA RAHMATUN WA MAGHFERATUNW\none whom Your blessings, mercy, and forgiveness reach. \nوَّ اجْعَلْنِىْ عِنْدَكَ وَجِيْهًا فِى الدُّنْيَا وَ الْاٰخِرَةِ \nWAJ A’LNEE I’NDAKA WAJEEHAN FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE\nAnd make me honorable in Your sight in this world and the Hereafter, \nوَ مِنَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ \nWA MENAL MOQARRABEENA \nand one of the near ones (to You). \nفَاِنِّىْ اَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِمُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nFA-INNEE ATAQARRABO ELAYKA BE-MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN \nFor I seek nearness to You through Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad; \nصَلَوَاتُكَ عَلَيْهِ وَ عَلَيْهِمْ اَجْمَعِيْنَ \nSALAWAATOKA A’LAYHE WA A’LAYHIM AJMA-E’ENA\nYour blessings be upon him and upon all of them.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ اِنِّىْ اَتَوَسَّلُ وَ اَتَوَجَّهُ\nALLAAHUMMA WA INNEE ATAWASSALO WA ATAWAJJAHO \nO Allah! And I beseech and turn toward You through \nبِصَفْوَتِكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ  وَ خِيَرَتِكَ مِنْ خَلْقِكَ \nBE-SAFWATEKA MIN KHALQEKA WA KHEYARATEKA MIN KHALQEKA\nYour choicest of creation and the best of Your creation: \nمُحَمَّدٍ وَّ عَلِىٍّ وَ الطَّيِّبِيْنَ مِنْ ذُرِّيَّتِهِمَا \nMOHAMMADIN WA A’LIYYIN WAT-TAYYEBEENA MIN ZURRIYYATEHEMAA\nMuhammad and Ali, and the pure ones from their descendants. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحِمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA FASALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah! So send blessings upon Muḥammad and the Household of Muhammad, \nوَّ اجْعَلْ مَحْيَايَ مَحْيَاهُمْ \nWAJ A’L MAHYAAYA MAHYAAHUM \nand make my life their life \nوَ مَمَاتِىْ مَمَاتَهُمْ \nWA MAMAATEE MAMAATAHUM \nand my death their death, \nوَ لاَ تُفَرِّقْ بَيْنِىْ وَ بَيْنَهُمْ فِى الدُّنْيَا وَ الْاٰخِرَةِ \nWA LAA TOFARRIQ BAYNEE WA BAYNAHUM FID DUNYAA WAL AAKHERATE\nand do not separate me from them in this world and the Hereafter. \nاِنَّكَ سَمِيْعُ الدُّعَآءِ \nINNAKA SAMEE-U’D DOAA-E\nSurely You are the Hearer of prayers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ هٰذَا يَوْمٌ تُجَدَّدُ فِيْهِ النِّقْمَةُ \nALLAAHUMMA WA HAAZAA YAWMUN TOJADDADO FEEHIN NIQMATO\nO Allah! This is a day on which retribution is renewed \nوَ تُنَزَّلُ فِيْهِ اللَّعْنَةُ \nWA TONAZZALO FEEHIL LA’NATO\nand the curse is sent down \nعَلَى اللَّعِيْنِ يَزِيْدَ وَ عَلٰى اٰلِ يَزِيْدَ \nA’LAL LA-E’ENE YAZEEDA WA A’LAA AALE YAZEEDA\nupon the accursed Yazid, and upon the family of Yazid,\nوَ عَلٰٓى اٰلِ زِيَادٍ وَ عُمْرَ بْنِ سَعْدٍ وَ الشِّمْرِ \nWA A’LAA AALE ZEYAADIN WA O’MAR ABNE SA’DIN WASH-SHIMRE\nand upon the family of Ziyad, and Umar ibn Sa’d, and al-Shimr. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْهُمْ وَ الْعَنْ مَنْ رَضِىَ بِقَوْلِهِمْ وَ فِعْلِهِمْ \nALLAAHUMMAL A’NHUM WAL A’N MAN RAZEYA BE-QAWLEHIM WA FE’LEHIM \nO Allah! Curse them and curse all who approved of their words and deeds, \nمِنْ اَوَّلٍ وَ اٰخِرٍ لَعْنًا كَثِيْرًا \nMIN AWWALIN WA AAKHERIN LA’NAN KASEERAN\nfrom the first to the last, with an abundant curse, \nوَ اَصْلِهِمْ حَرَّ نَارِكَ \nWA ASLEHIM HARRA NAAREKA\nand cast them into the heat of Your Fire,\nوَ اَسْكِنْهُمْ جَهَنَّمَ وَ سَآئَتْ مَصِيْرًا \nWA ASKINHUM JAHANNAMA WA SAA-AT MASEERAN\nand settle them in Hell—what an evil destination!\nوَّ اَوْجِبْ عَلَيْهِمْ \nWA AWJIB A’LAYHIM\nAnd decree upon them, \nوَ عَلٰى كُلِّ مَنْ شَايَعَهُمْ وَ بَايَعَهُمْ وَ تَابَعَهُمْ \nWA A’LAA KULLE MAN SHAA-YA-A’HUM WA BAA-YA-A’HUM WA TAA-BA-A’HUM\nand upon all who supported them, pledged allegiance to them, followed them, \nوَ سَاعَدَهُمْ وَ رَضِىَ بِفِعْلِهِمْ \nWA SAA-A’DAHUM WA RAZEYA BE-FE’LEHIM\nassisted them, and approved of their deed, \nوَ افْتَحْ لَهُمْ وَ عَلَيْهِمْ وَ عَلٰى كُلِّ مَنْ رَضِىَ بِذٰلِكَ\nWAF TAH LAHUM WA A’LAYHIM WA A’LAA KULLE MAN RAZEYA BE-ZAALEKA\nand unleash upon them, and upon all who approved of that, \nلَعَنَاتِكَ الَّتِىْ لَعَنْتَ بِهَا كُلَّ ظَالِمٍ\nLA-A’NAATEKAL LATEE LA-A’NTA BEHAA KULLA ZAALEMIN\nYour curses with which You cursed every oppressor, \nوَّ كُلَّ غَاصِبٍ وَّ كُلَّ جَاحِدٍ \nWA KULLA GHAA-SEBIN WA KULLA JAAHEDIN \nevery usurper, every denier, \nوَّ كُلَّ كَافِرٍ وَّ كُلَّ مُشْرِكٍ \nWA KULLA KAAFERIN WA KULLA MUSHREKIN \nevery disbeliever, every polytheist, \nوَّ كُلَّ شَيْطَانٍ رَّجِيْمٍ وَّ كُلَّ جَبَّارٍ عَنِيْدٍ \nWA KULLA SHAYTAANIR RAJEEMINW WA KULLA JABBARIN A’NEEDIN\nevery outcast devil, and every obstinate tyrant.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْ يَزِيْدَ وَ اٰلَ يَزِيْدَ \nALLAAHUMMAL A’N YAZEEDA WA AALA YAZEEDA\nO Allah! Curse Yazid, the family of Yazid, \nوَ بَنِىْ مَرْوَانَ جَمِيْعًا \nWA BANEE MARWAANA JAMEE-A’N\nand all of Bani Marwan. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ ضَعِّفْ غَضَبَكَ وَ سَخَطَكَ \nALLAAHUMMA WA ZA’-I’F GHAZABAKA WA SAKHATAKA\nO Allah! Multiply Your anger, Your displeasure, \nوَ عَذَابَكَ وَ نَقِمَتَكَ \nWA A’ZAABAKA WA NAQEMATAKA\nYour punishment, and Your retribution \nعَلٰٓى اَوَّلِ ظَالِمٍ ظَلَمَ اَهْلَ بَيْتِ نَبِيِّكَ \nA’LAA AWWALE ZAALEMIN ZALAMA AHLA BAYTE NABIYYEKA\nupon the first oppressor who oppressed the Household of Your Prophet. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ الْعَنْ جَمِيْعَ الظَّالِمِيْنَ لَهُمْ \nALLAAHUMMA WAL A’N JAMEE-A’Z ZAALEMEENA LAHUM\nO Allah! And curse all the oppressors against them \nوَ انْتَقِمْ مِنْهُمْ\nWAN TAQIM MINHUM \nand take vengeance on them. \nاِنَّكَ ذُوْ نِقْمَةٍ مِّنَ الْمُجْرِمِيْنَ \nINNAKA ZOO NIQMATIM MENAL MUJREMEENA\nIndeed, You are the Lord of Vengeance against the criminals.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ الْعَنْ اَوَّلَ ظَالِمٍ ظَلَمَ اٰلَ بَيْتِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA WAL A’N AWWALA ZAALEMIN ZALAMA AALA BAYTE MOHAMMADINW\nO Allah! And curse the first oppressor who oppressed the Household of Muḥammad, \nوَّ الْعَنْ اَرْوَاحَهُمْ وَ دِيَارَهُمْ وَ قُبُوْرَهُمْ \nWAL A’N ARWAAHAHUM WA DEYAARAHUM WA QOBOORAHUM\nand curse their souls, their homes, and their graves. \nوَ الْعَنِ اللّٰهُمَّ الْعِصَابَةَ الَّتِىْ نَازَلَةِ الْحُسَيْنَ بْنَ بِنْتِ نَبِيِّكَ \nWAL A’NIL LAAHUMMAL E’SAABATAL LATEE NAAZALATIL HUSAYNABNA BINTE NABIYYEKA\nAnd curse, O Allah! The gang that confronted al-Husayn, the son of Your Prophet's daughter, \nوَ حَارَبَتْهُ وَ قَتَلَتْ اَصْحَابَهٗ وَ اَنْصَارَهٗ \nWA HAARABATHO WA QATALAT ASHAABAHU WA ANSAARAHU\nand fought him, and killed his companions, his helpers, \nوَ اَعْوَانَهٗ وَ اَوْلِيَآئَهٗ وَ شِيْعَتَهٗ وَ مُحِبِّيْهِ \nWA AA’WAANAHU WA AWLEYAAA-AHU WA SHEE-A’TAHU WA MOHIBBEEHE\nhis assistants, his friends, his followers, his lovers, \nوَ اَهْلَ بَيْتِهٖ وَ ذُرِيَّتَهٗ \nWA AHLA BAYTEHI WA ZURRIYYATAHU\nhis household, and his descendants. \nوَ الْعَنِ اللّٰهُمَّ الَّذِيْنَ نَهَبُوْا مَا لَهٗ \nWAL A’NALIL LAAHUMMAL LAZEENA NAHABOO MAALAHU\nO Allah! Curse those who plundered his property, \nوَ سَلَبُوْا حَرِيْمَهٗ وَ لَمْ يَسْمَعُوْا كَلَامَهٗ وَ لَا مَقَالَهٗ \nWA SALABOO HAREEMAHU WA LAM YAS-MA-O’O KALAAMAHU WA LAA MAQAALAHU\nrobbed his sacred household (family), and neither listened to his words nor his speech. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ وَ الْعَنْ كُلَّ مَنْۢ بَلَغَهٗ ذٰلِكَ \nALLAAHUMMA WAL-A’N KULLA MAN BALAGHA-HU ZAALEKA \nO Allah! And curse all those, to whom this (tragedy) reached \nفَرَضِىَ بِهٖ مِنَ الْاَوَّلِيْنَ وَ الْاٰخِرِيْنَ \nFA-RAZEYA BEHI MENAL AWWALEENA WAL AAKHEREENA \nand who approved of it, from the first and the last, \nوَ الْخَلَآئِقِ اَجْمَعِيْنَ اِلٰى يَوْمِ الدِّيْنِ \nWAL KHALAA-EQE AJMA-E’ENA ELAA YAWMID DEENE \nand all of creation, until the Day of Judgment,\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ الْحُسَيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHIL HUSAYNA \nPeace be upon you, O Aba Abdillah al-Husayn, \nوَ عَلٰى مَنْ سَاعَدَكَ وَ عَاوَنَكَ \nWA A’LAA MAN SAA-A’DAKA WA A’AWANAKA \nand upon those who assisted you, helped you, \nوَ وَاسَاكَ بِنَفْسِهٖ وَ بَذَلَ مُهْجَتَهٗ فِىْ الذَّبِّ عَنْكَ \nWA WAASAAKA BE-NAFSEHI WA BAZALA MOHJATAHU FIZ ZABBE A’NKA\nshared their lives with you, and sacrificed their souls in defending you. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَاىَ وَ عَلَيْهِمْ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAAYA WA A’LAYHIM \nPeace be upon you, O my Master, and upon them, \nوَ عَلٰى رُوْحِكَ وَ عَلٰى اَرْوَاحِهِمْ \nWA A’LAA ROOHEKA WA A’LAA ARWAAHEHIM \nand upon your soul and upon their souls, \nوَ عَلٰى تُرْبَتِكَ وَ عَلٰى تُرْبَتِهِمْ \nWA A’LAA TURBATEKA WA A’LAA TURBATEHIM \nand upon your soil (grave) and upon their soil. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَقِّهِمْ رَحْمَةً وَّ رِضْوَانًا \nALLAAHUMMA LAQQEHIM RAHMATAWN WA RIZWAANAN \nO Allah! Bestow upon them mercy, pleasure, \nوَّ رَوْحًا وَّ رَيْحَانًا \nWA RAWHAWN WA RAYHAANAN \nhappiness and bounty.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَاىَ يَا اَبَا عَبْدِ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA A’BDIL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O my Master, O Aba Abdillah, \nيَابْنَ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّيْنَ \nYABNA KHAATAMIN NABIYYEENA \nO son of the Seal of the Prophets, \nوَ يَابْنَ سَيِّدِ الْوَصِيِّيْنَ \nWA YABNA SAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA\nO son of the Master of the Successors, \nوَ يَابْنَ سَيِّدَةِ نِسَآءِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ \nWA YABNA SAYYEDATE NESAAA-IL A’ALAMEENA\nand O son of the Mistress of the women of the worlds. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا شَهِيْدُ يَابْنَ الشَّهِيْدِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SHA-HEEDO YABNASH SHAHEEDE \nPeace be upon you, O Martyr, O son of the Martyr.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ بَلِّغْهُ عَنِّىْ فِىْ هٰذِهٖ السَّاعَةِ \nALLAAHUMMA BALLIGH-HO A’NNEE FEE HAAZEHIS SAA-A’TE\nO Allah! Convey to him from me, at this hour, \nوَ فِىْ هٰذَا الْيَوْمِ وَ فِىْ هٰذَا الْوَقْتِ \nWA FEE HAAZAL YAWME WA FEE HAAZAL WAQTE\non this day, at this time, \nوَ كُلِّ وَقْتٍ تَحِيَّةً وَّ سَلَامًا \nWA KULLE WAQTIN TAHIYYATAN WA SALAAMAN \nand at every time, a greeting and peace.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَابْنَ سَيِّدِ الْعَالَمِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA SAYYEDIL A’ALAMEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the Master of the Worlds,\nوَ عَلٰى الْمُسْتَشْهَدِيْنَ مَعَكَ \nWA A’LAL MUS-TASH-HADEENA MA-A’KA \nand upon those martyred with you—\nسَلاَمًا مُّتَّصِلًا مَّا اتَّصَلَ اللَّيْلُ وَ النَّهَارُ \nSALAAMAN MUTTASELAN MATTASALAL LAYLO WAN NAHAARO \na continuous peace for as long as the night and day are connected.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْحُسَيْنِ بْنِ عَلِىٍّ ۨ الشَّهِيْدِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAL HUSAYN IBNE A’LIYYENISH SHA-HEEDE \nPeace be upon al-Husayn ibn Ali, the Martyr.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى عَلِىِّ بْنِ الْحُسَيْنِ الشَّهِيْدِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAA A’LIYYIBNIL HUSAYNISH SHAHEEDE \nPeace be upon Ali ibn al-Husayn, the Martyr. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الْعَبَّاسِ بْنِ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ الشَّهِيْدِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAL A’BBAAS IBNE AMEERIL MOMENEENASH SHAHEEDE \nPeace be upon al-Abbas ibn Ameer al-Mu’meneen, the Martyr. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الشُّهَدَآءِ مِنْ وُّلْدِ اَمِيْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LASH SHO-HADAAA-E MIN WULDE AMEERIL MOMENEENA \nPeace be upon the martyrs from the children of Ameer al-Mu’meneen. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَى الشُّهَدَآءِ مِنْ وُّلْدِ جَعْفَرٍ وَّ عَقِيْلٍ \nASSALAAMO A’LASH SHOHADAAA-E MIN WULDE JA’FARIN WA A’QEELIN\nPeace be upon the martyrs from the children of Ja’far and Aqīl. \nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى كُلِّ مُسْتَشْهَدٍ مِّنَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAA KULLE MUSTASH-HADIM MENAL MOMENEENA \nPeace be upon every martyr among the believers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMADINW\nO Allah! Send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, \nوَّ بَلِّغْهُمْ عَنِّىْ تَحِيَّةً وَّ سَلَامًا \nWA BALLIGH-HUM A’NNEE TAHIYYATAN WA SALAAMAN \nand convey to them from me greeting and peace.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رَسُوْلَ اللهِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA RASOOLAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O Messenger of Allah, \nوَ عَلَيْكَ السَّلَامُ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ \nWA A’LAYKAS SALAAMO WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nand upon you be peace and the mercy of Allah and His bounties. \nاَحْسَنَ اللهُ لَكَ الْعَزَآءَ فِىْ وَ لَدِكَ الْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ \nAHSANAL LAAHO LAKAL A’ZAAA-A FEE WALADEKAL HUSAYNE A’LAYHIS SALAAMO\nMay Allah grant you excellent consolation for your son al-Husayn, peace be upon him.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا الْحَسَنِ يَا اَمِيْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAL HASANE YAA AMEERAL MOMENEENA\nPeace be upon you, O Aba al-Hasan, O Ameer al-Mu’meneen, \nوَ عَلَيْكَ السَّلَامُ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ \nWA A’LAYKAS SALAAMO WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU \nand upon you be peace and the mercy of Allah and His bounties. \nاَحْسَنَ اللهُ لَكَ الْعَزَآءَ فِىْ وَ لَدِكَ الْحُسَيْنِ \nAHSANAL LAAHO LAKAL A’ZAAA-A FEE WALADEKAL HUSAYNE \nMay Allah grant you excellent consolation for your son al-Husayn.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكِ يَا فَاطِمَةُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA FAATEMATO \nPeace be upon you, O Fatemah,\nيَا بِنْتَ رَسُوْلِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ \nYAA BINTA RASOOLE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA \nO daughter of the Messenger of the Lord of the Worlds, \nوَ عَلَيْكِ السَّلَامُ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ \nWA A’LAYKIS SALAAMO WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU \nand upon you be peace and the mercy of Allah and His bounties. \nاَحْسَنَ اللهُ لَكِ الْعَزَآءَ فِى وَلَدِكِ الْحُسَيْنِ \nAHSANAL LAAHO LAKIL A’ZAAA-A FEE WALADEKIL HUSAYNE \nMay Allah grant you excellent consolation for your son al-Husayn.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا مُحَمَّدٍۨالْحَسَنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAA MOHAMMADENIL HASANA \nPeace be upon you, O Aba Muhammad al-Hasan, \nوَ عَلَيْكَ السَّلَامُ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ \nWA A’LAYKAS SALAAMO WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU \nand upon you be peace and the mercy of Allah and His bounties. \nاَحْسَنَ اللهُ لَكَ الْعَزَآءَ فِىْ اَخِيْكَ الْحُسَيْنِ \nAHSANAL LAAHO LAKAL A’ZAAA-A FEE AKHEEKAL HUSAYNE \nMay Allah grant you excellent consolation for your brother al-Husayn.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلٰى اَرْوَاحِ الْمُؤْمِنِيْنَ وَ الْمُؤْمِنَاتِ \nASSALAAMO A’LAA ARWAAHIL MOMENEENA WAL MOMENAATIL \nPeace be upon the souls of the believing men and women, \nالْاَحْيَآءِ مِنْهُمْ وَ الْاَمْوَاتِ \nAH-YAA-E MINHUM WAL AMWAATE \nthose living among them and those deceased, \nوَ عَلَيْهِمُ السَّلَامُ وَ رَحْمَةُ اللهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ \nWA A’LAYHEMUS SALAAMO WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nand upon them be peace and the mercy of Allah and His bounties. \nاَحْسَنَ اللهُ لَهُمُ الْعَزَآءَ فِىْ مَوْلَاهُمُ الْحُسَيْنِ \nAHSANAL LAAHO LAHOMUL A’ZAAA-A FEE MAWLAAHOMUL HUSAYNE \nMay Allah grant them excellent consolation for their Master al-Husayn.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اجْعَلْنَا مِنَ الطَّالِبِيْنَ بِثَارِهٖ \nALLAAHUMMAJ-A’LNAA MENAT TAALEBEENA BE-SAAREHI \nO Allah! Make us among those who seek his vengeance \nمَعَ اِمَامٍ عَدْلٍ تُعِزُّ بِهِ الْاِسْلَامَ وَ اَهْلَهٗ \nMA-A’ EMAMIN A’DLIN TO-I’ZZO BEHIL ISLAAMA WA AHLAHU\nwith a just Imam through whom You shall strengthen Islam and its followers, \nيَا رَبَّ الْعَالَمِيْنَ.\nYAA RABBAL A’ALAMEENA.\nO Lord of the Worlds.\nYou may then prostrate yourself and say the following words:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ لَكَ الْحَمْدُ عَلٰى جَمِيْعِ مَا نَابَ مِنْ خَطْبٍ\nALLAAHUMMA LAKAL HAMDO A’LAA JAMEE-E’ MAA NAABA MIN KHATBIN\nO Allah! All praise is due to You for every serious event that occurred, \nوَّ لَكَ الْحَمْدُ عَلٰى كُلِّ اَمْرٍ \nWA LAKAL HAMDO A’LAA KULLE AMRIN \nand all praise is due to You for every matter. \nوَ اِلَيْكَ الْمُشْتَكٰى فِىْ عَظِيْمِ الْمُهِمَّاتِ \nWA ELAYKAL MUSH-TAKAA FEE A’ZEEMIL MOHIMMAATE \nAnd to You is the complaint regarding the greatest of hardships,\nبِخِيَرَتِكَ وَ اَوْلِيَآئِكَ \nBE-KHEYARATEKA WA AWLEYAAA-EKA \nconcerning Your chosen ones and Your saints, \nوَ ذٰلِكَ لِمَا اَوْجَبْتَ لَهُمْ مِنَ الْكَرَامَةِ وَ الْفَضْلِ الْكَثِيْرِ \nWA ZAALEKA LEMAA AWJABTA LAHUM MENAL KARAAMATE WAL FAZLIL KASEERE \nand that is because of the honor and abundant favor You made obligatory for them.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ \nALLAAHUMMA FA-SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADINW\nO Allah! So send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَّ ارْزُقْنِىْ شَفَاعَةَ الْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ \nWAR ZUQNEE SHA-FAA-A’TAL HUSAYNE A’LAYHIS SALAAMO \nand grant me the intercession of al-Husayn, peace be upon him,\nيَوْمَ الْوُرُوْدِ وَ الْمَقَامِ الْمَشْهُوْدِ \nYAWMAL WO-ROODE WAL MAQAAMIL MASH-HOODE \non the Day of Arrival (to You), at the Witnessed Station, \nوَ الْحَوْضِ الْمَوْرُوْدِ \nWAL HAWZIL MAWROODE \nand by the Watered Fountain. \nوَ اجْعَلْ لِىْ قَدَمَ صِدْقٍ عِنْدَكَ مَعَ الْحُسَيْنِ \nWAJ-A’L LEE QADAMA SIDQIN I’NDAKA MA-A’L HUSAYNE \nAnd grant me a true standing with You, along with al-Husayn \nوَ اَصْحَابِ الْحُسَيْنِ عَلَيْهِ السَّلَامُ \nWA ASHAABIL HUSAYNE A’LAYHIS SALAAMUL \nand the companions of al-Husayn, peace be upon him,\nالَّذِيْنَ وَاسَوْهُ بِاَنْفُسِهِمْ \nLAZEENA WAA-SAWHO BE-ANFOSEHIM \nWho were supportive of him with their souls, \nوَ بَذَلُوْا دُوْنَهٗ مُهَجَهُمْ \nWA BAZALOO DOONAHU MOHAJAHUM \nand sacrificed their lives for him, \nوَ جَاهَدُوْا مَعَهٗٓ اَعْدَآئَكَ ابْتِغَآءَ مَرْضَاتِكَ وَ رَجَآئَكَ\nWA JAAHADOO MA-A’HU AA’DAAA-AKAB TEGHAAA-A MARZAATEKA WA RAJAAA-AKA\nand struggled against Your enemies with him, seeking Your pleasure and hoping for Your favor, \nوَ تَصْدِيْقًاۢ بِوَعْدِكَ \nWA TASDEEQAN BE-WA’DEKA \nconfirming Your promise, \nوَ خَوْفًا مِّنْ وَّعِيْدِكَ \nWA KHAWFAM MIN WA-E’EDEKA \nand fearing Your threat. \nاِنَّكَ لَطِيْفٌ لِّمَا تَشَآءُ \nINNAKA LATEEFUL LEMAA TASHAAA-O\nIndeed, You are Kind to whosoever You will, \nيَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ.\nYAA ARHAMAR RAAHEMEENA.\nO Most Merciful of the merciful.",
  "merits": "This form of ziyarah on the ‘Ashura’ Day is not as famous as the earlier one; rather, it is similar to it in reward and merits although it does not comprise the one-hundred time statements of invoking curse on the enemies and invoking blessings on the Imam and his companions. It is considered a great success for one whom is diverted from that form of ziyarah by a more important matter. The method of this form of ziyarah, as quoted from the book of al-Mazar al-Qadeem, without mentioning the explanatory introduction, is as follows:\nIf you would like to visit Imam al-Husayn (a.s.) from remote places or from the vicinity of his holy tomb, you may bathe yourself and come out to a desert or go up the roof on your house. You may then offer a two-unit prayer, reciting (after Surah al-Faatehah) Surah al-Tawheed in both units. When you accomplish the prayer, you may point to Imam al-Husayn (a.s.) to greet him. The greetings, pointing, and intention must be made while turning the face towards the side of Imam al-Husayn (a.s.)’s tomb. Then, you may say the following words with reverence and submission:"
